    "Embedding 分布": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embedding Map"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Embedding 分布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPad 上默认是网格模式 —— 一眼看十几张，点一下就标记，比逐张滑动快得多。需要专注逐张判断时，右上角切到「滑动模式」，方向键 ↑ 保留 / ← 删除 / → 撤销，空格看原图。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On iPad the grid is the default — you can take in a dozen photos at once and mark one with a tap, which is far quicker than swiping through them. When you want to focus on one at a time, switch to Swipe mode from the top right: ↑ delete, ← keep for now, → always keep, ↓ undo, space to view full size."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPad 上默认是网格模式 —— 一眼看十几张，点一下就标记，比逐张滑动快得多。需要专注逐张判断时，右上角切到「滑动模式」，方向键 ↑ 保留 / ← 删除 / → 撤销，空格看原图。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
