    "你设置了「%@」的缓冲期。App 无法在后台自己动手删除，到期时会给你一条提醒，回来一键执行即可。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've set a grace period of “%@”. An app can't delete on its own in the background, so you'll get a reminder when the time is up — come back and confirm in one tap."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你设置了「%@」的缓冲期。App 无法在后台自己动手删除，到期时会给你一条提醒，回来一键执行即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
