    "分类头和可删性模型都会归零，回到出厂的规则判断。照片不受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both the category model and the deletability model reset to zero, falling back to the built-in rules. Your photos are untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分类头和可删性模型都会归零，回到出厂的规则判断。照片不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分类用的是 Apple Vision 的 FeaturePrint（768 维，跑在神经引擎上）作为固定骨干，上面挂一个几千参数的线性头，用你每一次滑动当训练样本。\n没有任何模型下载、没有联网、没有数据离开这台设备。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Classification uses Apple Vision's FeaturePrint (768 dimensions, running on the Neural Engine) as a frozen backbone, with a few-thousand-parameter linear head on top that learns from every swipe you make.\nNothing is downloaded, nothing is sent over a network, and no data leaves this device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分类用的是 Apple Vision 的 FeaturePrint（768 维，跑在神经引擎上）作为固定骨干，上面挂一个几千参数的线性头，用你每一次滑动当训练样本。\n没有任何模型下载、没有联网、没有数据离开这台设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
