    "执行第一次删除之后,这里会显示相册占用的变化趋势、空间主要来自哪些类目,以及每一次清理的明细。\n相册占用每天最多记录一次。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After your first deletion this shows how your library size is trending, which categories the space came from, and a log of every cleanup.\nLibrary size is recorded at most once a day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "执行第一次删除之后,这里会显示相册占用的变化趋势、空间主要来自哪些类目,以及每一次清理的明细。\n相册占用每天最多记录一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "扫描完成后，截图会按外观自动分团出现在这里。\n注意：分团依赖 Vision 的向量，模拟器上取不到，只有真机能用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a scan finishes, screenshots appear here grouped by how they look.\nNote: grouping relies on Vision feature vectors, which are unavailable in the Simulator — it only works on a real device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描完成后，截图会按外观自动分团出现在这里。\n注意：分团依赖 Vision 的向量，模拟器上取不到，只有真机能用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找出重复照片、聊天截图、游戏截图这些占地方又没用的东西，用最少的动作清掉它们。\n\n全部计算都在这台设备上完成 —— pHash 指纹和 Apple Vision 的神经引擎推理，没有任何数据离开你的手机。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finds the duplicates, chat screenshots and game captures that take up room and earn nothing, and clears them with as few taps as possible.\n\nEverything runs on this device — pHash fingerprints and Apple Vision inference on the Neural Engine. No data leaves your phone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找出重复照片、聊天截图、游戏截图这些占地方又没用的东西，用最少的动作清掉它们。\n\n全部计算都在这台设备上完成 —— pHash 指纹和 Apple Vision 的神经引擎推理，没有任何数据离开你的手机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
