    "标记 → 缓冲期 → 你确认执行 → 进入系统「最近删除」再放 30 天。\n注意：第三方 App 不能在后台自己执行删除，所以缓冲期到点是一条提醒，不是自动动手。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mark → grace period → you confirm → Recently Deleted holds them another 30 days.\nNote: a third-party app can't delete on its own in the background, so the end of the grace period is a reminder, not an automatic action."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标记 → 缓冲期 → 你确认执行 → 进入系统「最近删除」再放 30 天。\n注意：第三方 App 不能在后台自己执行删除，所以缓冲期到点是一条提醒，不是自动动手。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
