    "滑块只决定「几秒内算同一时刻」—— 这是个真正的判断题。当前约 %lld 秒。\n\n副本判定不可调，因为它由实测决定：真正的同一张图副本的 pHash 汉明距离 ≤ 1，放宽只会制造误判、多抓不到一张真副本。\n截图永远只能进「完全一致」这一档 —— 两张不同的收据在缩略图尺度上距离为 0，无法区分，所以不参与副本和连拍。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The slider only decides how many seconds still counts as “the same moment” — a genuine judgement call. Currently about %lld seconds.\n\nThe copy thresholds aren't adjustable, because measurement settled them: a true copy of the same picture sits at a pHash Hamming distance of 1 or less, and loosening that only manufactures false matches without catching a single extra real copy.\nScreenshots can only ever be “exact duplicates” — two different receipts are distance 0 apart at thumbnail scale, so they can't be told apart and never take part in the copy or burst logic."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "滑块只决定「几秒内算同一时刻」—— 这是个真正的判断题。当前约 %lld 秒。\n\n副本判定不可调，因为它由实测决定：真正的同一张图副本的 pHash 汉明距离 ≤ 1，放宽只会制造误判、多抓不到一张真副本。\n截图永远只能进「完全一致」这一档 —— 两张不同的收据在缩略图尺度上距离为 0，无法区分，所以不参与副本和连拍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点缩略图看大图。取消勾选就不会动这一组。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
