      }
    },
    "这一轮结束了": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That's the round done"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一轮结束了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这一项会用这一团里的**每一张**去训练本机的分类器 —— 一次命名等于几百个样本。之后同类截图不用再靠手写规则猜。\n「地图截图」「网页 / 社交截图」没有可靠的手写规则，只有这样标注过才会出现。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This trains the on-device classifier on **every photo** in the cluster — one naming action is worth hundreds of samples, and similar screenshots no longer have to be guessed at by rules.\n“Map screenshots” and “Web / social screenshots” have no reliable rule, so they only appear once you've labelled them this way."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这一项会用这一团里的**每一张**去训练本机的分类器 —— 一次命名等于几百个样本。之后同类截图不用再靠手写规则猜。\n「地图截图」「网页 / 社交截图」没有可靠的手写规则，只有这样标注过才会出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个 App 的截图算哪一类": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What kind of screenshots are these?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 App 的截图算哪一类"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些照片永远不会出现在待清理队列里。改动后需要重新扫描才生效。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These never enter the cleanup queue. Changes take effect on the next scan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些照片永远不会出现在待清理队列里。改动后需要重新扫描才生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这会把 %lld 项移入系统「最近删除」，释放 %@。\niOS 会再弹一次系统确认框。照片在「最近删除」里还能保留 30 天，之后才真正释放空间。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This moves %#@n@ to Recently Deleted, freeing %2$@.\niOS will ask you to confirm once more. Photos stay in Recently Deleted for 30 days; the space is only reclaimed after that."
          },
          "substitutions": {
            "n": {
              "argNum": 1,
              "formatSpecifier": "lld",
              "variations": {
                "plural": {
                  "one": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%lld item"
                    }
                  },
                  "other": {
                    "stringUnit": {
                      "state": "translated",
                      "value": "%lld items"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会把 %1$lld 项移入系统「最近删除」，释放 %2$@。\niOS 会再弹一次系统确认框。照片在「最近删除」里还能保留 30 天，之后才真正释放空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这张其实是…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is actually…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这张其实是…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里每一组都是**同一张图存了多份** —— 像素、尺寸、文件大小全都一样，删掉多余的不会丢任何东西，所以已经替你勾好了。\n不想动的可以取消勾选。分辨率或画质**有差别**的那些不在这里，它们需要你看大图来挑。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every group here is **the same picture stored several times** — same pixels, same dimensions, same file size. Deleting the extras loses nothing, so they're already ticked.\nUntick anything you'd rather leave. Versions that **differ** in resolution or quality aren't here; those need you to look at them full size."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里每一组都是**同一张图存了多份** —— 像素、尺寸、文件大小全都一样，删掉多余的不会丢任何东西，所以已经替你勾好了。\n不想动的可以取消勾选。分辨率或画质**有差别**的那些不在这里，它们需要你看大图来挑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "连拍或几秒内的多张 — 需要你挑出留哪一张": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A burst, or several shots seconds apart — you choose which to keep"
